WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.820
- [Narrator] Police in Maine
are on the hunt for an armed

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.370
and dangerous suspect
connected to two shootings

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.433
that officials say, killed
18 people Wednesday night.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.450
The massacre in Lewiston,
Maine's second largest city,

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.080
marked the country's deadliest
mass shooting in 2023 so far,

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.933
according to the research
group, Gun Violence Archive.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.940
Here's how the two shootings

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.883
that sent shockwaves through
the rural state unfolded.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.180
At 6:56 PM on Wednesday,

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.970
police said they received
a call of a male shooter

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.280
at the Just-In-Time
Recreation bowling alley

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.513
in Lewiston, Maine.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.220
Shortly after, at 7:08 PM,
police said they received

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.110
additional calls of an active shooter

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.000
at a restaurant called Schemengees,

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.403
roughly four miles away
from the bowling alley.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.450
Around 8:00 PM, authorities
released images on Facebook

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:49.923
of the suspected shooter.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.670
Maine State Police
issued a shelter-in-place

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.740
for local residents, urging them to stay

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.410
inside their homes with doors locked.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.530
State police later identified
40-year-old Robert Card

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.990
of Bowdoin Maine as the
sole person of interest

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.520
in the shootings.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.730
Around 10:00 PM, State Police
said in a social media post

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.130
that authorities located
a vehicle belonging

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.803
to Card at a nearby boat launch in Lisbon.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.940
- Police are currently
searching for a Robert R. Card,

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.540
4-4-1983 of Bowdoin.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.480
Card is considered armed and dangerous.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.430
- [Narrator] On Thursday,
residents in Lewiston

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.130
and nearby towns were
told to shelter-in-place

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.380
as officers searched for Card.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.660
Police confirmed that
seven people were killed

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.430
at Just-In-Time Recreation,

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:37.890
and eight people were
killed at Schemengees.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.860
Three people later died in the hospital.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:43.290
A White House spokesperson
said, President Biden

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:47.040
has been briefed and would
continue to receive updates.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.280
- This city did not deserve
this terrible assault

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:53.940
on its citizens, on its peace of mind,

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.243
on its sense of security.

00:01:56.243 --> 00:01:58.743
(sober music)

